  "contentHtml": "<p>1차시 활동으로 나온 산출물입니다~ 시간이 부족해서 두번째 시간에 대본 꾸미기를 하게 되었어요ㅎㅎ 두번째 활동은 재해재난 사례 조사인데 그 활동도 끝나면 활동지와 함께 산출물 올려볼게용<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e30397d05945f4cd90ffa25568fdc828d9887a3e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e30397d05945f4cd90ffa25568fdc828d9887a3e\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"998\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40edec6b6de28fd45f2f96d116dc4d012f2cea6c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40edec6b6de28fd45f2f96d116dc4d012f2cea6c\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1018\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/607631528cbd1582c4f5be31b5fce26369ef21ed\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/607631528cbd1582c4f5be31b5fce26369ef21ed\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1029\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2b023feda7ae8db8d50ff96f77c5ccfdd447c811\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2b023feda7ae8db8d50ff96f77c5ccfdd447c811\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1017\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
